{"projectInfo":{"name":"BGP LS配置举例","path":"bgp_ls","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"所有路由器运行BGP协议，Router A与Router B建立IBGP连接，Router B分别与Router C和Router D建立IBGP连接。Router B作为路由反射器，Router A为Router B的客户机。Router A能够通过Router B学到Router C和Router D发布的LS信息。","label":["BGP LS"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTD","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}